OL,3,GNEWSARamsey candidates debate town's
OL,4,Aelection issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoters in Ramsey will have the choice
OL,7,Fof six candidates when the Isle of Man
OL,8,Fgoes to the polls on 24 September to
OL,9,Felect 24 members of the House of Keys.
OL,11,FRobert Cowell, Nigel Dunmore, Lawrie
OL,12,FHooper, Juan McGuinness, Janine
OL,13,FShimmin, and Peter Whiteway are
OL,14,Fcontesting the two seats available in
OL,15,Fthe constituency.
OL,17,FSituated in the north, the town is the
OL,18,Fthird largest settlement on the island.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
