OL,3,GNEWSARamsey candidates debate town's
OL,4,Aelection issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnnabelle Tiffin was joined by five of
OL,7,Fthe six candidates for a debate on
OL,8,Fissues affecting the island- including
OL,9,Fthe economy, creating opportunities for
OL,10,Fyoung people to stay on the island, and
OL,11,Fplans for an offshore wind farm.
